# bin/ai/MANIFEST  (tracked: .gitignore gets !bin/ai/MANIFEST)
#   One entry per line: <kind> <path>. Lines starting with '#' and blank lines are ignored.
#   kind  entry   a host entry point: executable; the first thing it does is the refusal
#         source  a file a host program sources
#         image   a file copied into the image's build context
#         mount   a directory mounted into sandboxes, read-only
#   path  relative to the repository root; a path ending in '/' covers every file below it.
#   A path may appear under several kinds, one line each. Every listed path exists.

entry bin/ai/create-ai-sandbox.sh
entry bin/ai/ai-sandbox
entry bin/ai/ai-sandbox-account
entry bin/ai/ai-sandbox-attach
